# Binary fixtures must never be transformed on checkout. Git's heuristic
# already gets this right for the formats here, verified by comparing the
# checksum of the RAW fixture across a Linux and a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf enabled. This states it rather than relying on it, because
# a fixture whose bytes change is a test that fails for a reason nobody
# thinks to look for.
#
# Deliberately limited to binary formats. Marking the text files with a
# fixed newline would rewrite every source file in an existing working
# tree on Windows, and nothing in this project compares source bytes.

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.bmp binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.webp binary
*.dng binary
*.DNG binary
*.pdf binary
